    "detailed_description": "<strong>SUMMARY</strong><br><br>The ever so loved The Duck Song has returned.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2263340/extras/191f7b32fbbbc89e1c97ffa1d3aa9e61.avif?t=1674080032\" /></span><br><br><strong>GAMEPLAY</strong><br><br>You have become the clever duck who is now navigating through a sea of falling lemonade while trying to eat as many grapes as possible. With quick reflexes and careful planning, you must move left and right to avoid the lemonade and catch the juicy grapes. As the game progresses, the speed and number of falling objects increases, making for an increasingly challenging and exciting gameplay experience. With colorful graphics and intuitive controls, &quot;The Duck Song Game&quot; is a fun and engaging game for players of all ages. Got any grapes?",
